    printf('%.4f', 1.0 * COALESCE(f.female_only_count, 0) / t.total_movies * 100) 
        AS percentage_exclusively_female
FROM total_per_year AS t
LEFT JOIN female_per_year AS f
       ON t.year = f.year
ORDER BY t.year;
```
